					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "/F7SaMjXTx6yOxsGwp6Bvg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Documentation to add\n\n- Overview\n- Core model\n- Common workflows\n- Examples\n- Inspector views and tools\n- Configuration\n- Extension points\n\nKeep examples practical. A good component page should make someone want to try it immediately.\n"
			}
		]
